    third party the Corresponding Source at no more than a reasonable
    cost.

    c) Convey the object code in, or embodied in, a physical product
    (including a physical distribution medium), accompanied by a
    written promise to provide the Corresponding Source at no more
    than a reasonable cost.

    d) Convey the object code by providing access to copy the
    Corresponding Source from a designated place, at no more than a
    reasonable cost, and offering to give any third party access to
    the Corresponding Source from that same place.

    e) Convey the object code by using a peer-to-peer transmission
    medium, providing equal access to copies of the Corresponding
    Source via the same mechanism.

